WEBVTT

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:04.890
I'm not in middle school anymore.

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.460
Woah, easy girl.

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:38.810
All that hard work to get into
this high school was for your sake.

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:40.810
Where schoolgirls are
allowed to ride bikes.

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:47.630
Starting tomorrow, I'll have coffee.

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:48.840
Club Registration!!
Episode 1

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:52.750
Sakura Hane
High Schooler on her first day of school.

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:55.480
With only 546 yards remaining!

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:59.020
She's climbing the last hill!

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:07.940
I can't go on.

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:11.830
It looks like Sakura's decided
to walk and push her bike.

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:20.370
It's called a <i>bike</i> so why can't it <i>bike</i> itself.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.260
He just blew the red light!

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:43.930
My bike would never lose
to a rattle-trap bicycle like that!

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.110
Get in first gear!

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:54.070
What was all that?
Her engine revving was so annoying.

00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:57.930
Can you really ride a
motorcycle to school here?

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:07.260
Vrrrmm
mmmmmm!

00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.020
Vrm! Vrm!

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:14.460
Vroooom!!!

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:33.170
Why is it that every jerk riding
a bicycle acts like such an idiot?!

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:37.780
Wandering around the car lanes in
spandex and weird helmets!

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:44.720
Is that a middle-school helmet?

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:47.070
Vroooom!

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:49.100
And making motorcycle noises...

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:53.320
Ka-boom!

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:58.940
It's a motorcycle...

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:04.640
What's up with you?
Interested in motorcycles?

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:07.030
Because they're so cool!!

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:09.250
Nope nope, that's ridiculous.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:13.310
I just thought it would be easier
to get up the hills with one.

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:15.600
I absolutely have no interest.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:17.340
I don't think they're cool either.

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.750
Stalling the question, huh?

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:22.080
But, I guess it had an awesome sound.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:24.710
It's like nothing I've ever heard before.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.100
What's your birthday?

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.400
It's May 3rd...

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:32.360
One month til' you're 16, huh.

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.670
How about you get a bike?

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:39.800
You won't have to get all
sweaty climbing those hills everyday.

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:42.820
Me? Get a motorcycle?

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.140
Yeah.

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:47.040
Only an idiot
would ride a bike.

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:50.020
You're an idiot...

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:52.190
So you've got what it takes!

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:57.130
Amano Onsa, class 1-A.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.190
Nice to meet ya.

00:03:58.190 --> 00:04:00.420
I'm Sakura Hane.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:02.190
I'm in class A, too.

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.190
Do you have time after school?

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:06.580
Come hang out with me.

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:08.470
I guess...

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:12.170
After School

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:13.010
Bike Club!!

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:14.300
Bike Club?
Bike Club!!

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:14.330
Bike Club?

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:15.590
Yeah.

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:18.690
This school has no rules about motorcycles.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:23.580
In other words, we're free to ride our
bikes to school, or even make clubs.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:29.010
I'm coming in.

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:36.570
Aaaaaaaaaah!!

00:04:39.590 --> 00:04:42.380
Jeez, you sure surprised us.

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:44.240
So your name's Stig?

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:49.360
It seems this Stig is the only member of the club.

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:52.080
Honestly, I don't want to join.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:52.200
Notes
joining the Bike Club.
I am interested in
Name
Grade
Date
Club Registration

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:52.480
Club Registration
Date
Grade
Name
I am interested in
joining the Bike Club.
Notes

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:54.090
No way!!

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:56.540
I don't want to spend my
years as a student with this Stig!!

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:02.880
Maybe I'd join if she joined at least...

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:06.450
Hey, I just thought of something.

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:09.420
What do you do when it rains?

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:12.170
If it rains, you'll get wet.

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:14.730
Ehhh?
That's no good...

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:17.440
I guess I shouldn't
bother with bikes then...

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:20.090
Wait!
Don't decide that so quickly!!

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:23.590
Motorcycles are so amazing that
they make up for their disadvantages.

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:24.730
How so?

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:29.370
Well...

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:39.430
Umm... Well...

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:41.440
How are bikes so great?

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:45.020
The wind and freedom!

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:03.430
I'm getting on with you?

00:06:13.270 --> 00:06:16.790
The sound's making my bottom vibrate.

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:35.880
We're leaning!

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:38.060
We're leaning a lot!!!

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:41.770
Your hair's hitting me, ow!

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:48.520
It's so bumpy, and painful. I don't like this ride!!

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:51.270
Motorcycles are a big no!

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:54.740
What could I say to get Hane on a bike?

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:57.370
"It's really exciting to ride on a bike?"

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:01.050
"Ride a bike to fill the gaping hole in your soul?"

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:02.890
"You'll become one with nature?"

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:07.450
Why are all these reasons for
riding so stale?!

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:12.650
There's no use of using such words
to get someone to ride a bike.

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:14.610
The reasons people ride bikes?

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.940
Why do people bike?

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:20.650
You get wet if it rains.

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:23.160
You get cold in the winter.
And it's hot in the summer.

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:26.570
They breakdown really easily, and
if you're not careful, you can get injured.

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:28.520
Aaaah!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:33.490
But even so, the reason
we ride bikes is...

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:40.810
Listen up, Hane.

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:43.870
We ride bikes because...

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:47.840
As high-school girls, we can only ride bikes!

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:49.190
Onsa-chan.

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:51.500
I'm gonna get a motorcycle.

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:54.920
Alright, that's the right thing to do, Hane!

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:57.110
First you need to read bike magazines!

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:57.770
Kay!

00:07:57.800 --> 00:07:59.770
And start drooling over the bikes you want!

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:00.490
Kay!

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:02.200
And then you've gotta get your license!!

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.200
Kay!

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:05.750
What's a license?

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:09.410
I'm hoooooome.

00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:10.820
Welcome home, Onee-chan.

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:11.390
Sakura

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:16.620
Hey, Yume, guess what girls can
do when they turn 16?
Sakura

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:18.030
Uhhh
Get married?
Sakura

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:19.330
Uhhh
Get married?

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:20.650
Bzzzt!!

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:23.500
The answer is:
They can get a motorcycle license.

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:25.140
You can get a license?

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:30.010
I'm sure, Dad and Mom
will be happy for me!

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:36.160
Oh? You're already in driving school?

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:36.930
Yup.

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:38.930
My classes start today.

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:43.560
That aside, did your parents say anything
about you riding a motorcycle?

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:46.470
My parents?

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:52.310
They're not around.

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:55.930
My parents went somewhere
far far away...

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.260
Woah! I didn't expect that.

00:08:58.540 --> 00:09:02.320
But my sister Yume said that
it was ok for me to get a license.

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:05.360
She even gave me the money.

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:08.880
Is that so? That's good, I guess...

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:12.920
By the way, did you make sure to apply
for a standard two-wheeler, right?

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:14.730
Of course!

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:18.190
My height and weight are normal after all!

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:22.220
Uh, the size of the driver
doesn't matter...

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:26.020
Stig said she has
a license for big bikes.

00:09:27.820 --> 00:09:30.050
Wait, is that her chest size?

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:37.030
Hane, there exists one single barrier
for you to get your license.

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:38.230
A barrier?

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:39.520
Yes.

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:42.560
The biggest challenge
of motorcycle lessons:

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:44.930
standing up a fallen bike with all your might!

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:46.950
The Bike Left Test!!

00:09:49.340 --> 00:09:53.460
Well, once you get the hang
if it, it ain't so bad.

00:09:53.460 --> 00:09:56.130
So, you're able to do it, Onsa-chan?

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:57.260
Of course.

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:58.930
Wow!

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:01.860
110-kilo is about 250 pounds
Lifting a 110-kilo Seron ain't a big deal,

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:04.300
But maybe I should show
her how it's done.

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:13.540
1000CC
A liter bike?!

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:15.470
Do your best, Onsa-chan!!

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:17.240
Y-Yeah..

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:19.100
How many kilos is this thing?

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:23.980
Around
530lbs----

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:33.790
So heavy!!

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:35.670
If I drop it, the cowl will break,

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:38.820
and it'll cost me a ton to repair!

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:42.260
Shoot, I'm done...

00:10:51.930 --> 00:10:57.130
Just once in a girl's life, she'll only have
to lift something so heavy by herself.

00:10:57.160 --> 00:10:59.900
Just one time, during the Bike Lift Test.

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:03.360
If you can pass it, then you'll be able to ride.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:09.910
So listen carefully, you have
to talk to your bike as you ride it.

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:14.330
Alright, Sakura-san.
Try lifting the bike as demonstrated.

00:11:14.330 --> 00:11:16.130
Yes, Instructor-dono!!

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:19.770
Hup!

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:24.160
I can't.

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:27.560
Instructor, how was that?!

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:29.020
You didn't do it at all.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:33.500
I think you should go for a
smaller frame bike license.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:36.480
No, mine aren't that small!!

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:38.820
Please let me try one more time!!

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:41.370
First, go to the back of the line.

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:43.560
It's a lonely battle, huh?

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:47.380
I never thought about my
reason for riding as much

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:49.910
as I did when I took that Bike Lifiting Test.

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:53.330
There are lots of
reasons to not ride a bike.

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:58.170
So as long as you have one
reason then you've gotta ride.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:11.210
Why am I pushing myself this hard?

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:14.810
Oh, I know.

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:18.000
It's because of what I felt that time.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:20.190
I want to experience it again!

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:31.500
But I can't even lift it...

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:36.450
I can't ride motorcycles.

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:38.100
Step forward with your right foot.

00:12:38.930 --> 00:12:41.770
And push it up with your whole body.

00:12:41.970 --> 00:12:43.090
Like this?

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:46.260
Lift with my whole body?

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:48.360
Yeah.

00:12:48.360 --> 00:12:50.680
I'm going to ride motorcycles.

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:56.020
I'm gonna ride forever
until the road ends.

00:12:56.020 --> 00:13:00.480
I'm going to go see Dad and Mom.

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:03.110
All the way to America, where they live.

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:05.980
Oh, they're not dead.

00:13:13.570 --> 00:13:17.970
It sounds different from Onsa-chan
or Stig's motorcycles.

00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:21.860
Oh yeah, whose voice was that, though?

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:24.170
You finally did it.

00:13:24.850 --> 00:13:26.480
I'm over here.

00:13:27.310 --> 00:13:29.020
TL Note: Bike + Worker
I'm Baita.

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:34.140
I'm a soulless machine who makes
money for the training school,

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:35.980
giving her body to countless men.

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:37.840
S-So this is...

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:41.020
the "talking to your bike" that
Onsa-chan was talking about?!

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:45.530
Do you know what it's like to
have a man's crotch on your face?

00:13:45.530 --> 00:13:46.360
Bakuon!!
Do you know what it's like to
have a man's crotch on your face?

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:46.930
Bakuon!!

00:13:50.030 --> 00:13:50.970
Bakuon!!

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:55.330
Ah, you studying?

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:58.160
Ah, the written exam.
That takes me back.

00:13:58.160 --> 00:13:59.050
Yeah.

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:02.330
There's lots of road signs.
It's hard to remember them all.

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:04.010
How are your basics?

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:05.820
Are you at stage two yet?

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:07.760
I'm doing well with that.

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:10.450
The motorcycle tells me everything after all.

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:12.260
Wait, Hane.

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:17.820
When you say cool lines like
<i>that</i>, you gotta look like <i>this</i>

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:23.360
"The bike taught me everything in life."

00:14:26.640 --> 00:14:30.520
Onsa-chan, since the test's gonna
start now I gotta go, see ya later!

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:35.670
Hey, look. There's still people
riding to school on a motorcycle.

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:37.500
How unusual.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:41.560
How naughty.

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:44.920
Hayakawa?

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:47.590
There is something I wish of you to bring.

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:52.270
Fuel, Oil, Tires, Chain, Engine,

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:54.470
Clutch, Lights, Mirrors.

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:55.950
Ready to roll!!

00:14:55.950 --> 00:15:00.200
Hane-chan, it's a good thing to check the bike
before riding it,

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:03.170
but it's even more important to
inspect the man before mounting him.

00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:05.960
First, check his shoes.

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:08.950
Then check what color his credit
cards are, and how many he has.

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:11.250
Number 3: Sakura Hane.

00:15:11.250 --> 00:15:12.420
Here I go!

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:14.120
Hane-chan, you listening?

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:18.660
Half clutching is so hard.

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:21.910
I get shakey whenever I start moving.

00:15:21.910 --> 00:15:25.550
Do the gachon pose with your fingers.

00:15:25.550 --> 00:15:26.700
"Gachon"?

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:29.430
TL Note: "Heisei' is an era that starts at 1989 and is the current era of Japan.
My my, you're such a Heisei kid.

00:15:29.430 --> 00:15:32.160
It's like you're scratching a guy you hate.

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:33.430
Like this?

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:36.790
That's right.

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:39.430
Handling a bike is just like handling a man.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:43.100
Take command and run 'em 'till
they're about to collapse!!

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:53.390
Great work!

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:54.700
Thanks again for today.

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:56.130
Nice work!

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:06.030
Oh my. That girl's done it again.

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:07.800
Is her motorcycle okay?!

00:16:07.800 --> 00:16:11.090
Oh come on, I hate this bike.

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:14.650
Why are all the bikes at this
school stupid Hondas?!

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:18.330
Huh?

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:20.720
I think she's in my class...

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:23.930
You came to get your license too
right, Suzunoki-san?

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:25.540
Just call me Rin.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:26.910
Okay, Rin-chan.

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:28.620
You can just call me "Hane" then.

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:30.360
Got it, Hane.

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:33.080
By the way, are you okay?

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:35.620
It looked like you should've died.

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:38.200
I just don't like that bike.

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:41.770
You know how this school uses Super Fours?

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:42.870
"Super Fours"?

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:44.200
Yeah.

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:46.990
Honda's CB400 Super Four.

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:48.800
Super Four for short.

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:54.330
By the way, have you decided what bike
you're going to get when you get your license?

00:16:54.330 --> 00:16:56.020
No, not yet!

00:16:56.020 --> 00:16:57.220
What about you, Rin-chan?

00:16:57.230 --> 00:16:59.510
I have my own bike already.

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:03.410
Superman!

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:11.870
My bike is Japan's Best, no, the World's Best
super cool motorcycle in all of history!

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:15.670
Bike Club?

00:17:15.670 --> 00:17:18.160
There's a club like that at our school?

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.880
Are yours extra-large?

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:21.830
What?

00:17:22.210 --> 00:17:25.500
Huh?
You're going to training school too, Suzunoki?

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:29.170
Also it's my first time seeing
someone in a racing suit.

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:32.660
Hey, wanna go look at the bike dealerships?

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:34.900
Since Hane hasn't chosen a bike yet.

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:36.970
Yeah! Let's go! Let's go!

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:40.590
You say that, but have you
